3.  DOES TREE DEPTH DRIVE THE DEAD ZONE?  (it does -- in the opposite direction)
================================================================================================
More leaves means more splits on price, so a small step is MORE likely to cross one.
The dead zone therefore shrinks with depth.  Bias is mildly U-shaped and is not
what delta is controlling.

